      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GUNNIE GUNFIGHTER (1) has been racing well in Northern Queensland, and that form should transfer nicely to this circuit with a similar dirt surface to what he has had experience on. If not in need of the run, he should be hard to hold out. SNAPPY SWEETHEART (6) made a nice return to some good form again when finishing third here 6 days ago. She is facing a similar small field, and can continue to improve. Stick with her on an each-way basis. PAFITIS (4) sat just off the pace and finished strongly for second here last start, and he maps to receive the run of the race from the pole position. If the gaps come, he can have the last say. PREDICTING (2) followed up his recent Kununurra win with an easy all-the-way victory here 6 days ago against most of his rivals here. The hat-trick beckons. MEET ME AT THE BAR (3) was a touch above himself last start and weakened in the run home. He is good enough to make amends.",
